                "title": "Clear Crystal Empire Knob with Egg and Dart Plate, Brass Accents D05-K568-EMP",
                "description": "Brass Accents D05-K568-EMP, Clear Crystal Empire Knob with Egg and Dart Plate - The Empire Knob with Egg and Dart Plate features a modern clear crystal knob with a beautifully detailed backplate to make a latchset that is great for contemporary homes. The Egg and Dart Plate is available in a wide selection of finishes including oil rubbed bronze, polished brass, and satin nickel. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
